  "authorNotes": "Showdown / race, 2-4 players, everyone spawns together on the start platform under the big top. Two gaps, same reach budgets as the campaign (trampoline-race-a's bounce, trapeze-race-b's 320px bar flush with pier B's own edge), no assist beams — Showdown is a contest, not a tutorial. goal.requires is 'any': the instant one player's head crosses the goal shape the round ends, matching §8.2's 'first to the goal wins'. relic-w3-a sits on the middle pier as an optional detour for the haul/flawless objectives, which score independently of who wins the round (§7's per-player scoring, not the win condition)."
